# Static analysis, held at level 5.
#
# ADR 0021 originally named level 8. Measured against this codebase level 8
# reports 96 errors and level 5 reports 31, and a gate that runs is worth more
# than one that is aspired to — so 5 is the enforced floor and the remaining
# errors stay recorded in ADR 0029 item 5 as a later hardening phase.
#
# There is deliberately no baseline. A baseline would turn known defects into a
# green check, which is the failure mode this project has already met twice: an
# architecture rule guarding a namespace nothing imported, and a secret scan that
# reported clean because it had stopped looking.
includes:
    - vendor/larastan/larastan/extension.neon

parameters:
    level: 5

    paths:
        - app
